# Ecommerce Frontend Walkthrough

## What Was Completed
- Scaffolded a fast, modern React frontend using Vite in the `frontend` directory.
- Configured React Router for comprehensive page navigation (`/login`, `/signup`, `/admin-dashboard`, `/customer-dashboard`, `/add-product`, `/update-product/:id`).
- Established API communication via Axios configured to hit `http://localhost:8081/api`.
- Integrated Bootstrap CSS for a clean, responsive layout across all views.
- Created robust authentication flows and Role-Specific Dashboards (AdminDashboard and CustomerDashboard).
- Added CRUD functionality with [AddProduct](file:///Users/david/antigravity/frontend/src/pages/AddProduct.jsx#5-97) and [UpdateProduct](file:///Users/david/antigravity/frontend/src/pages/UpdateProduct.jsx#5-113) views.
- Added comprehensive navigation "Back" buttons.

## Validation Strategy
- The application compilation has been explicitly tested, and the server now runs actively on `http://localhost:5173/`.

